      <h1 class="jr-h1">Collagen for Dark Circles: Does It Actually Help?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Every collagen brand hints that it will brighten your under-eyes, and not one of them can point to a trial that measured it. Here is what dark circles actually are, how to tell which kind you have, and which treatments have numbers behind them.</p>

